    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but they aren't seeing it. i see it in their eyes when they look exhausted. it feels so selfish to keep forcing them to carry me. if i really loved them, i wouldn't keep making them suffer through this. it almost feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just... stop being a problem for them. like, if i wasn't here, they could finally breathe again.",
